title: 'Aura: Unify the Seal + PreDigest code between node + runtime'

doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Node Dev]
    description: |
      Moves the AuRa seal and pre-digest handling into `sp-consensus-aura`, so it is shared
      between the node and the runtime.

crates:
  - name: sp-consensus-aura
    bump: minor
  - name: sc-consensus-aura
    bump: major
  - name: cumulus-pallet-aura-ext
    bump: patch
